{"id":"5645","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5645_main_altocumulus-lenticularis-duplicatus-pile-d-assiette_clouds-photometeors-special-clouds-and-other-features.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>图为成块的荚状高积云，典型的透镜形状及轮廓清晰平滑。有些云块层叠在一起（复云类），在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span>可见，使之像一叠盘子（法语为pile d'assiettes）。在大部分荚状云块的边缘和较薄部分可看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">绿色以及尤其是粉色的虹彩</span>。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">小的积状云簇表明是絮状高积云</span>，这是另一个明显可识别的云种。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Marcin Kocybik","location":"塞尔维亚，波格丹诺维奇","latitude":"纬度: 42° 25' 25'' N","longitude":"经度: 21° 47' 49'' E","date":"28 September 2014 0000 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: P.20.4.3","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.20.4.3"}]}]}